## hostapd 2.11 configuration keys: every key hostapd_config_fill() (hostapd/config_file.c) accepts in
## Alpine's build of hostapd 2.11 (#ifdef'd options limited to what its APKBUILD enables), plus the keys of
## build/hostapd/300-noscan.patch. Source: https://w1.fi/releases/hostapd-2.11.tar.gz
## (sha256 2b3facb632fd4f65e32f4bf82a76b4b72c501f995a4f62e330219fe7aed1747a). A trailing * is a prefix.
## Regenerate on the build host: sh tools/ci.d/wifi.sh --keys (tools/ci.d/wifi.sh fails when this is stale).
## Used by mr/mod_wifi_test.go and tools/ci.d/wifi.sh: every key mr renders into hostapd configs must be here.
